name inputenx
category Package
revision 52986
shortdesc Enhanced input encoding handling
longdesc This package deals with input encodings. It provides a wider
longdesc range of input encodings using standard mappings, than does
longdesc inputenc; it also covers nearly all slots. In this way, it
longdesc serves as more uptodate replacement for package inputenc.
